    "sections": {
        "description": "Create a professional local supermarket website with this modern and responsive theme designed for supermarkets, local grocery shops, organic food stores, vegetable markets, dairy shops, and food retailers. The clean homepage layout highlights featured products, special offers, popular categories, and seasonal promotions to enhance customer engagement. Built with a user-friendly interface, the theme provides intuitive navigation, product search, promotional banners, and customizable sections that help showcase fresh produce, beverages, household essentials, and daily groceries. Fully responsive and optimized for performance, it delivers a seamless shopping experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. The theme supports WooCommerce, enabling secure online ordering, inventory management, shopping carts, and multiple payment options. Easy customization options allow users to personalize colors, typography, layouts, and widgets without coding knowledge. SEO-friendly code, fast loading speed, and translation readiness help businesses reach a wider audience while creating a reliable and visually appealing local supermarket website for grocery delivery services, neighborhood food markets, and retail stores."
    },
